+## Checking against your budget
+
+The `budget` command shows how much you spent in each category for a month
+alongside the limits you have configured, so you can see at a glance what is
+over or under:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+Category budgets are set in the configuration (see `tally/config.py`). Any
+category that has no configured limit is omitted from the output.
+
